WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:04.600
You already took the photos.

00:04.600 --> 00:08.800
Thousands of them. Sitting in the dark.

00:08.800 --> 00:14.400
Rooney goes through all of it.

00:14.400 --> 00:20.000
She finds the threads — the same garden, the same smile, years apart.

00:20.200 --> 00:23.700
Every thread becomes a film.

00:23.900 --> 00:28.300
Films of your family's life — made as you're living it.

00:28.400 --> 00:33.900
— and an ordinary evening becomes the night everyone gathers round.

00:33.900 --> 00:39.500
Roon. Relive the moments. roonapp.co
